From: PS5 Linux Kernel Team <kernel@ps5-linux.local>
Subject: [PATCH 3/13] ps5_defconfig: enable MediaTek MT7921E PCIe wireless driver

Enable kernel configuration symbols for MT7921E PCIe Wi-Fi support
found on PlayStation 5 Slim and CFI-12xx chassis revisions.

Signed-off-by: PS5 Linux Kernel Team <kernel@ps5-linux.local>
---
 arch/x86/configs/ps5_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/x86/configs/ps5_defconfig b/arch/x86/configs/ps5_defconfig
index a21c841..e5b7219 100644
--- a/arch/x86/configs/ps5_defconfig
+++ b/arch/x86/configs/ps5_defconfig
@@ -2616,5 +2616,7 @@ CONFIG_MT76_CORE=m
 CONFIG_MT76_LEDS=y
 CONFIG_MT76_CONNAC_LIB=m
+CONFIG_MT7921_COMMON=m
+CONFIG_MT7921E=m
 CONFIG_MT7663_USB_SDIO_COMMON=m
 CONFIG_MT7663U=m
 # CONFIG_MT7915E is not set
-- 
2.43.0
